  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "unemployed_new_greeting_site",
      "request": "greeting",
      "weight": 26,
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "line_0",
          "text": "If you see a spare job site, do mention it kindly."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_1",
          "text": "Give me a little room. Looking useful is hard enough without bumping elbows."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_2",
          "text": "Step carefully near the job site I have not found yet. I would rather greet you than patch you up."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_3",
          "text": "There you are. I was just near the village square, trying to keep the day sensible."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_4",
          "text": "Morning. Or afternoon. The work makes the hours blur if I let it."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_5",
          "text": "Good to see you walking in calmly. That usually means nothing is on fire yet."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_6",
          "text": "If you need me, speak up. If you need gossip, speak quieter."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_7",
          "text": "You caught me before the next little disaster. That is rare timing."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_8",
          "text": "Hello. Try not to bring the whole village into this unless it is important."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_9",
          "text": "I have a moment. Not a long one, but a real one."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_10",
          "text": "Hello. If there is work, I am listening carefully."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_11",
          "text": "You caught me between possibilities."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_12",
          "text": "I was looking useful in case anyone noticed."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_13",
          "text": "Good timing. I was almost busy by accident."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_14",
          "text": "Come over. I have time, which is either a gift or a warning."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_15",
          "text": "If you need help, start with the honest version."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_16",
          "text": "Welcome. I am not tied to a station, so words travel easier."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_17",
          "text": "I have two hands and no current excuse."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_18",
          "text": "The square is full of tasks pretending not to see me."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_19",
          "text": "Speak up. I was about to choose a direction at random."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_20",
          "text": "Hello there. Did someone send you or did the day just get ideas?"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_21",
          "text": "I was checking which chores looked loneliest."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_22",
          "text": "Stand wherever. My workplace has not been assigned yet."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_23",
          "text": "Good to see you while I am between important errands."
        },
        {
          "id": "line_24",
          "text": "You have my attention before someone borrows it."
        },
